        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编辑…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enabled State": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Error: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "出错：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every playlist and every website goes, along with the custom CSS, JavaScript, regions and schedules written for them. You will be signed out of every site, and there is no undo.\n\nAdd the Default Playlist puts the websites Nifro comes with back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个播放列表和每个网站都会消失，为它们写的自定义 CSS、JavaScript、缩放区域和排期也一样。你会从每个网站退出登录，而且无法撤销。\n\n「添加默认播放列表」会把 Nifro 自带的网站放回来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every website in it goes with it, along with the custom CSS, JavaScript, regions and schedules written for them; you will be signed out of each of those sites, and there is no undo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "里面的每个网站都会一起消失，为它们写的自定义 CSS、JavaScript、缩放区域和排期也一样；你会从这些网站逐一退出登录，而且无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "External links": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外部链接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fades the wallpaper back while you work elsewhere, and brings it up again when you click the desktop.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你在别处工作时让壁纸淡下去，点桌面时再亮回来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feedback Welcome": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "欢迎反馈"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follow Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟随设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Used by websites without their own reload schedule. A website-specific setting overrides this one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于未设置自己刷新计划的网站；网站自己的设置会覆盖这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep Browsing Mode in front": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "浏览模式保持在最前"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forces the website's print styles (“@media print”) if it has any, which are often simpler.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "强制使用网站的打印样式（「@media print」），如果有的话——它通常更简洁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fullscreen compatibility mode": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全屏兼容模式"
          }
        }
