    "Use a separate reload interval for this page. When off, it follows the interval in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为此页面设置单独的刷新间隔。关闭后，它会使用“设置”中的全局间隔。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How see-through the wallpaper is against the desktop behind it; Browsing Mode always draws it fully opaque.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "壁纸相对于背后桌面的透明程度；浏览模式下始终完全不透明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you cannot see the website, hide some windows to reveal the desktop.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果看不到网站，收起一些窗口把桌面露出来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Nifro": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Nifro 中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the default browser": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在默认浏览器中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Incorrect directory.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目录不对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inject your own CSS or JavaScript into this website. Most websites need neither.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "给这个网站注入你自己的 CSS 或 JavaScript。绝大多数网站两个都不需要。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspired by [Plash](https://github.com/sindresorhus/Plash) by Sindre Sorhus.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "灵感来自 Sindre Sorhus 的 [Plash](https://github.com/sindresorhus/Plash)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Invalid URL for the “add” command.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「add」命令的网址无效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Invalid URL: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "URL 无效：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Invert colors": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "反转颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inverts every colour on the website, as a fake dark mode for sites that have none.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "反转网站的全部颜色，给没有深色模式的网站做一个假的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Is Current": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "是当前网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Is Enabled": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已启用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its custom CSS, JavaScript, region and schedule go with it, you will be signed out of the site, and there is no undo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为它写的自定义 CSS、JavaScript、缩放区域和排期会一起消失，你会从这个网站退出登录，而且无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JavaScript": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JavaScript"
          }
        }
      }
