      }
    },
    "Nifro is off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nifro 已关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nifro is open source and its issue tracker is open. If something is broken, missing, or just annoying, the feedback button in the app goes straight there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nifro 是开源的，问题追踪也是公开的。有东西坏了、缺了，或者只是用着别扭，app 里的反馈按钮直接通向那里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nifro is open source under the MIT licence.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nifro 以 MIT 许可开源。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nifro lives in the menu bar, towards the right of the screen. Click its icon and choose “Add Website…” to get started.\n\nUse “Browsing Mode” when you need to log into a site or interact with it. Everything you do there is remembered, so you only have to sign in once.\n\nNot sure what to put up there? “Site Gallery…” in the same menu lists pages that work well as wallpapers, each with the settings that make it work.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nifro 待在菜单栏靠右的位置。点它的图标，选“添加网站…”就可以开始了。\n\n需要登录网站或者和它交互时，用“浏览模式”。在那里做的一切都会记住，所以只需登录一次。\n\n不知道该放什么？同一个菜单里的“推荐站点…”列出了适合当壁纸的网页，每条都附带让它好用的设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Playlist": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无播放列表"
          }
        }
