    "Shortcuts": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快捷键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shortcuts act on the display the pointer is on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快捷键作用于鼠标位置所在显示器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show Menu Bar Icon": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示菜单栏图标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show Whole Page": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示整页"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Showing": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Site Gallery": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推荐站点"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Site Gallery…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推荐站点…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starts Nifro when you log in, so the wallpaper is already up when you reach the desktop.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录时自动启动 Nifro，你到桌面时壁纸已经在了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep this page displayed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "固定显示此页面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suggest a site…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推荐网站…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch to Next Website": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换到下一个网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch to Previous Website": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换到上一个网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch to Random Website": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换到随机一个网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switched off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switches Nifro to a random website in the list.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换到列表里随机一个网站。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switches Nifro to the next website in the list.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换到列表里的下一个网站。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switches Nifro to the previous website in the list.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换到列表里的上一个网站。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you unplug your Mac, Nifro hides every wallpaper and restores your desktop picture. It brings them back when you plug in again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拔掉电源后，Nifro 会隐藏所有网页壁纸并恢复桌面图片；重新接通电源后会自动恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows only the video, so it fills the wallpaper without navigation, recommendations or comments.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只显示视频本身，让它铺满壁纸，不显示导航、推荐和评论。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The built-in default playlist cannot be bound to a display, so duplicate it first and bind the copy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原生默认播放列表不可绑定显示器。请复制后再绑定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The command “%@” is not supported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不支持“%@”这个命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The copy gets its own websites, so a region, a stylesheet or a reload interval changed in one list leaves the other alone. It does not copy logins: every site the original is signed in to, the copy is signed out of.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "副本会拿到属于它自己的网站，所以在一个列表里改缩放区域、样式表或刷新间隔，不会影响另一个。它不会复制登录状态：原列表已登录的每个网站，副本都是未登录的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The default for websites that have not answered this themselves, in their own settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有在自己的设置里回答这个问题的网站，用这里的默认值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The page is laid out at the size of the wallpaper, so `100vw` and `100vh` mean that area, and `<html>` carries `is-nifro-app` always and `nifro-is-browsing-mode` while Browsing Mode is on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "页面按壁纸的大小排版，所以 `100vw`、`100vh` 指的就是那块区域；`<html>` 上一直有 `is-nifro-app`，浏览模式开着时还有 `nifro-is-browsing-mode`。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nifro restores your wallpapers after restarting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新启动后，Nifro 会自动恢复网页壁纸。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The websites Nifro comes with go into your default playlist, and a default playlist is made if you do not have one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nifro 自带的网站会进入你的默认播放列表；如果你没有默认播放列表，会新建一个。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This page did not load": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此页面未能载入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
