    "Up to date": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已是最新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use print styles": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用打印样式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Crop in the panel to choose which part of the page fills the wallpaper. Nifro remembers the position and zoom level.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在面板中使用“裁切”选择网页的哪一部分铺满壁纸。Nifro 会记住位置和缩放级别。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the video-only page": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用纯视频页面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Useful with rotation — a news page in the morning, something calmer at night; a window that runs past midnight, 22 to 6, works.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配合轮换很好用——早上放新闻，晚上放安静点的；跨过午夜的时段（22 到 6）也可以。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Username": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用户名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Website": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Websites": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to Nifro!": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "欢迎使用 Nifro！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When in dark mode": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "深色模式下"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose where links from this page open. Select “In Nifro” when you need to sign in or keep navigating within the same site.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择此页面中的链接在哪里打开。需要登录或继续浏览同一网站时，请选择“在 Nifro 中打开”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow or mute this website's media. This controls audio and video elements, but not sound made with the Web Audio API.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许或静音此网站的媒体声音。它会控制页面中的音频和视频元素，但无法控制通过 Web Audio API 生成的声音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whole page": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整页"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With this off, the colour only changes when the website does.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭后，菜单栏颜色只在网站变化时才跟着变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A nature film, a live camera, a map, a dashboard — anything a browser can draw.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自然影片、实时摄像头、地图、仪表盘——浏览器画得出来的都行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You will need to log in through Browsing Mode once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要先用浏览模式登录一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zoom In": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "放大"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zoom Out": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
